          "originX": 0,
          "originY": 0,
          "values": {"message": "Count Venizi: \"You fiends! How did you escape?\"\nCount Venizi: \"You're ruining my strategy for taking over Missouri!\"\nPolenta: \"Your strategy for what?\"\nPanettone: \"That, aah, sounds Missouri-ble\"\nCount Venizi: \"NO! YOU'RE MISSOURI-BLE!\"\nMuji: \"I think he's trying to say 'miserable'...\"\nBoromi: \"Woah! Is that there count some kinda ghost or what?\"\nCount Venizi: \"I'M NOT A GHOST EITHER!\"\nCount Venizi: \"You rats are putting me in a sour mood.\"\nCount Venizi: \"Get out of here!\"\nCount Venizi: \"No, I'm not crying! There's something in my eyes!\"\nMuji: \"Those are tears.\"\nCount Venizi: \"SHUT UP! You win!\"\nAnd so the Count was down...\nCongratulation!"}
